<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    Release C's peoples in Rimfolk's existing world events and visitors (Source/ColonyCouncil/Peoples/; docs/design/
    peoples.md, "Release C"), as release A's are in Patches/Rimfolk_Peoples.xml. Each patches one of Rimfolk's own defs and
    is conditional, so it never fails: with the def gone, nothing happens. A preference never shuts another people out:
    without a people of the calling, everything comes as before.

    - World events that prefer a calling (SituationFactionNeed.calling: five times as likely as another people): a great
      pilgrimage, a holy year and a prophet on the roads the pilgrim fellowship's; an old vault opened and the comet the
      learned society's; busy orbital lanes and a ship come down the spacer enclave's; the flood downriver and the ice
      road the river folk's.
    - Visitors that prefer a calling (HappeningExtension.prefers, read by the events' own workers): hungry pilgrims,
      pilgrims to the colony's relic and pilgrims to its anima tree the fellowship's; a travelling scholar and a book
      swapper the learned society's.
  -->

  <!-- ===================== The pilgrim fellowship's world events ===================== -->

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ColonyCouncil.WorldSituationDef[defName="Council_WS_Pilgrimage"]/faction</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
      <xpath>Defs/ColonyCouncil.WorldSituationDef[defName="Council_WS_Pilgrimage"]/faction</xpath>
      <value>
        <calling>pilgrims</calling>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ColonyCouncil.WorldSituationDef[defName="Council_WS_HolyYear"]/faction</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
      <xpath>Defs/ColonyCouncil.WorldSituationDef[defName="Council_WS_HolyYear"]/faction</xpath>
      <value>
        <calling>pilgrims</calling>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ColonyCouncil.WorldSituationDef[defName="Council_WS_Prophet"]/faction</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
      <xpath>Defs/ColonyCouncil.WorldSituationDef[defName="Council_WS_Prophet"]/faction</xpath>
      <value>
        <calling>pilgrims</calling>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

